[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Once a god forsaken city, "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "where the bodies of angels "
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "littered the streets..."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "Much has changed in Santa Destroy."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Giant corporations,"
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "rampant city development..."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "The assassin's underworld has "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "become a commodity."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "A chance for profit, and"
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "entertainment for the masses."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "But shadows from the wilder days"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "still linger."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Travis-- a man who slashed his way "
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "to the top,"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "then walked away-"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "has become an urban legend "
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "many even doubt was real."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Here, the strong devour the weak,"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "the weak kneel before the strong,"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "and those who wield true power watch,"
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "and count their gold."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "And in this mass-produced savagery,"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "one truth is constant."
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "With each shattered life,"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "the same vow is uttered"
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "I will have revenge. "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "And no assassin can ever "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "walk away from that."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "He must draw his beam,"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "and stand against the madness."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "This is Travis Touchdown's "
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "Desperate Struggle."
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "Hold it, you violence loving bastard."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Before you start your desperate struggling,"
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "you should drop a nice save!"
  }
]